# Backend-specific rules; secrets, OS and IDE files are covered by the root .gitignore.

### Maven ###
target/
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
.flattened-pom.xml
dependency-reduced-pom.xml

### Gradle (in case of migration) ###
.gradle/
build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### Spring ###
HELP.md
# Personal overrides with real credentials: keep them out of git.
src/main/resources/application-local.yml
src/main/resources/application-local.yaml
src/main/resources/application-local.properties
config/application*.yml
config/application*.properties

### STS / NetBeans ###
.apt_generated
.springBeans
.sts4-cache
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/

### Local media uploads (app.media.storage-root) ###
/var/
